OL,3,GNEWSAA taxi driver sniffed out fake
OL,4,Acash - here's how you can spot it too
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat would you do if you suspected you
OL,7,Fhad been handed fake cash?
OL,9,FLast month, one taxi driver in
OL,10,FNottingham was so suspicious, he
OL,11,Fdecided to drive his customer straight
OL,12,Fto a police station, and the man was
OL,13,Flater arrested on suspicion of several
OL,14,Foffences.
OL,16,FCounterfeit notes are easier to spot
OL,17,Fsince the switch from paper to polymer,
OL,18,Fbut some still slip through.
OL,20,FSo how can you make sure you're not
OL,21,Fcaught out, and how common is fake
OL,22,Fcash?
